{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSButton","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSButtonV","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"macOS"},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Button is a UI element that triggers an action or event, and is used to initiate tasks or confirming an action.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Button appears in different layouts, styles and states to indicate hierarchy or emphasis.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(icon:accessibilityLabel:flipIcon:appearance:style:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:appearance:style:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:icon:flipIcon:appearance:style:action:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/Appearance","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/Style"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSButton"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Actions"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Five appearances are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default (by default)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Default buttons are used for actions which are not mandatory or essential for the user.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"strong","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Should be singular and prominent, limited to one per view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It should be reserved for the most critical action, such as “Next,” “Save,” “Submit,” etc. It is a “call for action”."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"brand","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A brand primary color alternative to the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"strong"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" button.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To be used sparingly for high-value specific actions or to visually anchor a brand moment. Do not use it as the default primary button in your interfaces.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A button with ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Brand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"minimal","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Minimal buttons are commonly used for actions that are considered less crucial. They can be used independently or together with a strong button.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Negative buttons should be used sparingly to warn of a destructive action,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example, delete or remove, typically resulting in the opening of a confirmation dialog."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A button with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Negative"},{"type":"text","text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    OUDSButton(icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\") { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative,  style: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ A loading button","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with strong appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Validate\", icon: Image(\"ic_heart\"), appearance: .strong) { \/* the action to process *\/ }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need to flip your icon depending to the layout direction or not (e.g. if RTL mode lose semantics  \/ meanings):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    OUDSButton(text: \"Button\",","               icon: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","               flipIcon: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Styles","level":2,"text":"Styles","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two style are available:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used in the normal usage of button. The aspect of the button changes for  states "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"disabled","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"pressed","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"hovered"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or normal (i.e. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"enabled","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used after button was clicked and probably data are requested before navigate to a next screen or get updated data.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Rounded-layout","level":2,"text":"Rounded layout","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Buttons can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To activate the rounded button behavior, set to true the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedButtons"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SoshTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WireframeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Colored-surface","type":"heading","text":"Colored surface","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If button is placed on colored surface using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrome mode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remark: Today it is not allowed to place a Negative nor a Brand button on a colored surface."}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Specific-behavior","type":"heading","text":"Specific behavior","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For accessibility reasons, if the system settings for reducing motion is enabled, the loading indicator does not move."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the device is in low power mode, the loading indicator does not move."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-button","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","level":2},{"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools","type":"heading","text":"Orange Business Tools","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_OrangeBusinessTools"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Version","type":"aside"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.10.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbutton"],"